Q.65: It was to beP: before their school examinationQ: which was due to startR: the last expeditionS: in a monthThe correct sequence is:(a) SRQP (b) RQSP (c) RPQSQ.65: Acmrding to reporBP: were still trapped insideQ: bogies of the oeressR: the wreckedS: some of the passengersThe mrrect sequence is:(a) PQRS (b) PSQR (c) RSQP
